  "title": "园区3d可视化线上三维展示数字孪生平台",
  "date": "2024-02-29",
  "summary": "",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-559.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-2-29/20242291731289860.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">5g浪潮的到来加速了数字化的发展。3d园区可视化</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">综合管理平台可实现数字园区人口、经济、应急等服务的三维数字化、网络化，实现优化管理决策支持和可视化管理。商迪</span>3D通过3D地理信息系统、</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">、三维可视化、虚拟现实虚拟现实技术、</span>IOT等基础技术，整合城市信息资源，搭建基础信息平台，打造数字园区信息系统，实现经济信息化、大数据可视化、管理决策智能化。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">3d园区可视化实现园区三维场景漫游</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">基于</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">3D公园可视化管理系统，应用3D可视化技术功能，扩展到整个公园，应用于</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">3D可视化智能公园建设门，数字公园3D可视化可实现各种形式的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">3D公园3D场景浏览、漫游，仿佛在真实的公园环境中，对整个公园有全面、直观的了解，体验公园漫游带来的真实感受。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">3d园区可视化实现数据监控可视化</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">通过与三维可视化园区属性数据对接，展示园区</span>3D物联网、</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">、大数据等信息和功能应用，并在平台上直接点击对象查看</span>3D园区的相关数据信息，实现监控数据的可视化。除了实时监控数据信息值外，还可以快速定位和监控园区设备的空间位置，实现一站式智能操作和维护，紧密结合数据资源，实现物联网三维可视化园区数据信息的实时动态多方位信息交互。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">3d园区可视化实现与园区警告联动可视化</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">通过接口连接各种三维可视化园区数据监控系统，将三维数字园区视频监控与三维数字园区管理系统集成，可以远程管理园区内的所有监控，从而全面了解三维可视化园区的实时监控系统。当三维可视化数据监控值达到阈值或刺激报警信息时，系统自动显示报警信息，高亮度标明报警信息设备的三维公园空间位置，支持声音报警信息等功能，及时提醒用户处理报警信息.</span></p><p><br /></p>",
